📋 Quick Summary of Changes
 
🎨 Visual
 
- Emojis → SVG Icons — look the same everywhere, crisp at any size
- Color palette — shifted to modern slate/blue-gray tones
- Spacing — tighter vertical text, cleaner card proportions
- Divider line — subtle separator below the title
- Hover effects — cards lift slightly on hover
 
♿ Accessibility
 
-  <title>  +  <desc>  — screen readers announce what the graphic is
-  role="img"  — identifies as a single graphic
-  aria-labelledby  — links labels to the SVG element
- Semantic text:  &amp;  instead of  &  for valid XML
 
📐 Responsiveness
 
-  width="100%" height="100%"  — scales to fit any container
- Preserves aspect ratio via  viewBox 
- Works on mobile, docs, presentations, websites
 
 
 
